 784:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****     \post       None\n
 785:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****     \note       This handler count down pieces of milliseconds. In order to save code
 786:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****                 space, milliseconds are measured by pieces of 1024 microseconds. So, the
 787:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****                 optimizer will use simple shift operations instead of code expensive
 788:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****                 computations. Moreover, the check cycle timer is maintained based on the
 789:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsCom.c ****                 range of an unsigned char, that is the maximum span for one cycle will be
